{"id":"10786116fd4ee461","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermInstProof.md","title":"PolyTermInstProof","display":"PolyTermInstProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTermInstProof","parameters":["c","h","s","t","u","z2049"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTermInstProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>h</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>z2049</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 双绑定替换与规约。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>h</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>、<code>z2049</code>。</p>\n<p>项 β 的绑定删除：经过 h 个类型绑定时，插入项先作类型提升 h，再作项提升 c。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTermInstProof c h s t u z2049)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z2052\n  (exists z2053\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z2049 z2052)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z2049 z2053)\n        (and\n          (exists z2095\n            (and\n              (exists z2096\n                (and (exists z2097 (and (@ Pair t u z2097) (@ Pair s z2097 z2096))) (@ Pair h z2096 z2095)))\n              (@ Pair c z2095 z2053)))\n          (forall z2050\n            (implies\n              (in z2050 z2052)\n              (exists z2051 (and (@ App z2049 z2050 z2051) (@ PolyTermInstRow z2049 z2050 z2051))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f3ba1faefd4054f9\" href=\"?note=f3ba1faefd4054f9\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTermInstRow\">PolyTermInstRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTermInstProof c h s t u z2049)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermInstRow|PolyTermInstRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Last","status":"resolved","id":"d72dedf3d7200b4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermInstRow|PolyTermInstRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermInstRow|PolyTermInstRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTermInstRow","status":